# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Build outputs
dist/
build/

# Capacitor: android/ and ios/ are both generated on Linux and COMMITTED (each has its own
# nested .gitignore keeping build artifacts, the copied web bundle, and the generated
# capacitor.config.json out). ios/ used to be regenerated on the Codemagic macOS runner each
# build, which silently wiped any Info.plist edit — including the location permission strings
# the background-location feature cannot work without. Committing it is what makes that native
# config durable. See .scratch/live-location-stage-2/mobile-standup-runbook.md.

# Signing keys and other secrets. keys/ holds Apple .p8 private keys (App Store Connect API
# key, APNs auth key) — they are downloadable exactly once from Apple, grant API access to the
# whole developer account, and must never reach the repo. The wildcards below are a backstop so
# a stray key outside keys/ is still ignored. Real home for these: a password manager / vault;
# CI reads them from Codemagic's encrypted env, same rule as deploy.sh.
keys/
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

